{
  "description": "3層（ALB → ECS Fargate → RDS PostgreSQL）。VPC は2AZ、パブリック／プライベート／DB のサブネット、NAT は1つ。踏み台は prod のみ。",
  "edges": [
    {
      "confidence": "derived",
      "from": "alb/demo-alb",
      "id": "alb/demo-alb->ecs_service/demo-app",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "HTTP 8080",
      "note": "参照はサービス → ターゲットグループだが、向きは ALB → サービス（R-LB-TG）。SG の app_from_alb も同じ組（E-MERGE）",
      "to": "ecs_service/demo-app"
    },
    {
      "confidence": "confirmed",
      "from": "ecs_service/demo-app",
      "id": "ecs_service/demo-app->db_instance/demo-db",
      "kind": "data",
      "label": "TCP 5432",
      "note": "タスク定義の環境変数 DB_HOST が DB のアドレスを参照（E-ENV-REF、確定）。ラベルは SG から（E-MERGE の 3）",
      "to": "db_instance/demo-db"
    },
    {
      "confidence": "derived",
      "from": "external/internet",
      "id": "external/internet->alb/demo-alb",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "HTTP 80",
      "to": "alb/demo-alb"
    },
    {
      "confidence": "derived",
      "from": "subnet/demo-private-ap-northeast-1a",
      "id": "subnet/demo-private-ap-northeast-1a->nat_gateway/demo-ap-northeast-1a",
      "kind": "route",
      "label": "0.0.0.0/0",
      "to": "nat_gateway/demo-ap-northeast-1a"
    },
    {
      "confidence": "derived",
      "from": "subnet/demo-private-ap-northeast-1c",
      "id": "subnet/demo-private-ap-northeast-1c->nat_gateway/demo-ap-northeast-1a",
      "kind": "route",
      "label": "0.0.0.0/0",
      "to": "nat_gateway/demo-ap-northeast-1a"
    },
    {
      "confidence": "derived",
      "from": "subnet/demo-public-ap-northeast-1a",
      "id": "subnet/demo-public-ap-northeast-1a->internet_gateway/demo",
      "kind": "route",
      "label": "0.0.0.0/0",
      "to": "internet_gateway/demo"
    },
    {
      "confidence": "derived",
      "from": "subnet/demo-public-ap-northeast-1c",
      "id": "subnet/demo-public-ap-northeast-1c->internet_gateway/demo",
      "kind": "route",
      "label": "0.0.0.0/0",
      "to": "internet_gateway/demo"
    }
  ],
  "evaluation": {
    "assumptions": [
      "environment / EnvType は dev（複数環境のため A4 で最初に確認する想定）"
